DESCRIPTION:No one combines stand-up comedy\, improvised music and audience
  interaction like Chris Turner. This unique skillset proved a hit with the 
 American public\, who voted him runner-up on Season 20 of America’s Got T
 alent \, making him the highest placed comedian in 10 years\, and the top-r
 anking rapper the show has ever seen.\n\nChris was one of the first comedia
 ns to ever perform a Las Vegas residency with Cirque Du Soleil \; defeated 
 ChatGPT in TED’ s inaugural Man vs. Machine rap battle\; and his appearan
 ces on America’s Got Talent and The Late Show with Stephen Colbert earned
  him rapturous standing ovations. Based in New York\, he’s a regular head
 line act at the world famous Comedy Cellar\, with over 125 million views on
 line thanks to his unmatched improvisational talent. Chris’s one-of-a-kin
 d approach to crowd-sourced musical comedy make his live shows a unique and
  unforgettable experience that has to be seen to be believed.\n\n”Absolut
 ely hilarious…Brilliant. Brilliant. Brilliant” – Simon Cowell\n\n“O
 ne of the most unique and innovative acts ever…genuinely has to be seen t
 o be believed” – NBC\n\n“Very funny\, uniquely appealing... nobody on
  a Vegas stage does what he does” Las Vegas Review-Journal\n\nManagement 
